@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

[*] --> Search

state Search
Search : entry / idle
Search : do / allow Filter Selection
Search : exit / filter Selected

state "Filter Selection" as FilterSelection
FilterSelection : entry / select Category
FilterSelection : do / select Price Range
FilterSelection : exit / criteria Chosen

state SearchResults <<choice>>
FilterSelection --> SearchResults

state ResultsDisplay
ResultsDisplay : entry / display Matching Users
ResultsDisplay : do / allow Further Interaction
ResultsDisplay : exit / search Complete

SearchResults --> ResultsDisplay

ResultsDisplay --> [*]

@enduml
